    "text": "Justice Department releases new list of so-called sanctuary jurisdictions\nBy TIM SULLIVAN,\n15 hours agoThe Justice Department identified some three dozen states, cities and counties as so-called sanctuary jurisdictions on Tuesday, two months after the federal government quietly removed a much longer list that included many localities that support the Trump administration’s hard-line immigration policies. The earlier, typo-riddled list was met with pushback...",
